EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000047> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000001> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000086> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000027> ObjectHasValue(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000077> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000043>))) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000086> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000390> ObjectHasValue(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000077> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000029>)))))
