AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000141> "space group is a quality of some crystal  that defines the symmetry combining all point group symmetries with all lattice translation symmetries"@en)
